## Hosted

```bash
./portal serve . --addr :8080     # serves the site and /api/*
```
{% endif %}

## Publish

- **GitHub Pages / any static host**: push the whole directory. Keep `data/` next to the HTML, or set `deploy.data_base_url` in `manifest.json` and rebuild to serve large files from object storage.
- **Zenodo / DOI**: upload the directory as a zip. Record the DOI in `manifest.json` (`doi`) and rebuild so the Cite box shows it.

## AI agents (MCP)

```bash
claude mcp add {{ m.id }} -- portal mcp /path/to/{{ m.id }}-portal
```

